{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"yuanzhang-e-o103","title":"邴原在辽东，一年中往归原居者数百家，游学之士教授之声不绝，后得归","accounts":[{"id":"yuanzhang-a-664c91d0a0d0d8f80c9a","label":"正文","text":"邴原在辽东，一年中往归原居者数百家，游学之士教授之声不绝，后得归","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-00d48f5c3d0b7a24b6ea"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-b699fdd9a85670ce48fb","label":"裴注·原别传","text":"邴原积十余年后乃遁还，南行数日而公孙度甫觉，度称邴君云中白鹤非鹑鷃之网所能罗，原遂免危难","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-f1b5e6b1fe5404f0e36f"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-d5c26fdeb3f52420f98d","label":"裴注·傅子","text":"邴原性刚直清议以格物，公孙度以下心不安之；管宁谓原潜龙以不现成德、言非其时皆招祸之道，密遣令西还","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-7e7d7673b4f816bff292"]}],"participants":[{"person":"yuanzhang-p0075","role":"在辽东，一年中往归原居者数百家，游学之士教授之声不绝，后得归；积十余年后乃遁还，南行数日而公孙度甫觉，遂免危难；性刚直清议以格物，公孙度以下心不安之","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-00d48f5c3d0b7a24b6ea","yuanzhang-q-f1b5e6b1fe5404f0e36f","yuanzhang-q-7e7d7673b4f816bff292"]},{"person":"gongsuntao-p0007","role":"知原不可复追，曰邴君所谓云中白鹤，非鹑鷃之网所能罗矣，又吾自遣之勿复求也；以下心不安邴原","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-f1b5e6b1fe5404f0e36f","yuanzhang-q-7e7d7673b4f816bff292"]},{"person":"huanchen-p0600","role":"谓邴原潜龙以不现成德，言非其时皆招祸之道，密遣令西还","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-7e7d7673b4f816bff292"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-00d48f5c3d0b7a24b6ea","yuanzhang-q-f1b5e6b1fe5404f0e36f","yuanzhang-q-7e7d7673b4f816bff292"]},"ordering_evidence":"yuanzhang-q-00d48f5c3d0b7a24b6ea","source_order":[11,315,248],"order":2626}],"persons":[{"id":"gongsuntao-p0007","name":"公孙度","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"huanchen-p0600","name":"管宁","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"yuanzhang-p0075","name":"邴原","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yuanzhang-q-00d48f5c3d0b7a24b6ea","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-616f1086bdb6d3f6ca69","layer":"original","quote":"原在辽东，一年中往归原居者数百家。游学之士，教授之声，不绝。后得归","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":314,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":248,"end":281},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-7e7d7673b4f816bff292","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-1e77d6c23c1dd6d6ec82","layer":"pei","quote":"邴原性刚直，清议以格物；度以下，心不安之。宁谓原曰：‘潜龙以不现成德；言非其时，皆招祸之道也。’密遣令西还","attribution":"裴注·傅子","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4958052ff2433e6ba0c5","start":99,"end":152},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-f1b5e6b1fe5404f0e36f","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-f117f39bbee4400e1c45","layer":"pei","quote":"积十余年，后乃遁还。南行已数日，而度甫觉。度知原之不可复追也，因曰：‘邴君所谓云中白鹤，非鹑鷃之网所能罗矣！又吾自遣之，勿复求也。’遂免危难","attribution":"裴注·原别传","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":341,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-73e160afdb3d08400061","start":369,"end":439}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
